01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
A Nice Indian Boy is a 2025 American romantic
comedy film directed by Roshan Sethi.

11
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
Based on Madhuri Shekar's play of the same name, the film follows Naveen, an Indian-American doctor, who
brings his fiancé, Jay, a white man adopted by Indian parents, to meet his traditional family.

12
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
It stars Karan Soni, Jonathan Groff, Sunita Mani, Zarna Garg, and Harish Patel.

13
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
The film premiered at South by Southwest on March 12, 2024, and was released
in the US on April 4, 2025, by Blue Harbor Entertainment.

14
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
The film explores themes of coming out, interracial
romance, lgbt, gay romance, traditional family.

15
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
